data: {"id": "428ffe9d93a5472e-thinking-parallel_evidence-1096", "run_id": "428ffe9d93a5472e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我已收到 baseline 结果。关键事实：\n1. **PromQL**: `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1, reason=\"ContainerCreating\"；Pod 处于 Pending 阶段，未重启。这确认了异常仍在持续。\n2. **Logs**: empty。这是预期的，因为容器未启动。\n3. **Tracing**: empty, pod_ip is empty。这也是预期的，因为 Pod 未分配 IP。\n\n现在我需要执行 Kubernetes 侧的确诊工具：describe、events、yaml。这将帮助区分 ImagePull、VolumeMount、SandboxCreate 分支。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788431684498, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

