data: {"id": "428ffe9d93a5472e-thinking-parallel_evidence-1699", "run_id": "428ffe9d93a5472e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，基于已采集的 Kubernetes 事实，进行证据评估：\n\n**已确认事实 (支持 ContainerCreating 的根因):**\n1. **Pod 状态**: Pending, phase=Pending。ContainerStatus: ready=False, reason=ContainerCreating, exitCode=None。异常仍在持续。\n2. **核心事件 (kubectl_events & describe)**:\n   - 事件类型: `Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox` (来自 kubelet) 和 `Warning NoNetworkFound` (来自 Multus CNI plugin)。\n   - 错误详情: `cannot find a network-attachment-definition \"unavailable-network\" in namespace (aiops-case-05)`。\n   - 频率: 60分钟内重复 265+ 次。\n3. **注解关联**: `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788431708135, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

